#: lib/randos_web/live/about_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The interface is quiet on purpose. The goal is low-pressure human presence, not performance or engagement loops."
msgstr "Muonekano wa mtumiaji umekusudiwa kuwa tulivu kwa makusudi. Lengo ni kuwezesha uwepo wa mtumiaji kwa njia ya asili na utulivu, si kwa lengo la kuonyesha uwezo au kuhamasisha shughuli za kurudia-rudia."

#: lib/randos_web/live/about_live.ex
